id: pm-jira-native-backend-context
title: Adopt the shared native backend context in Jira persistence
description: "Pinned SDK 2026.11.4 exposes only pmRoot/cwd/author/noExtensions in PmClientOptions; item and workspace transactions require pmRoot. Native backend selector missing. Dependency: upstream backend contract #1587/#1399; no package pin change in this slice."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: sdk-gap,"upstream:pm-cli#1587"
created_at: "2026-11-06T16:50:18.734Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-06T17:18:06.108Z"
author: codex-astra
acceptance_criteria: "Use the shared native SDK context for settings, identity, complete reads, writes, history and transactions without a tracker directory or subprocess bridge; Preserve filesystem callers and dry-run/auth gates; declare capabilities and refuse unsupported CAS/history/transactions before writes or emit an explicitly weaker receipt; Review compatibility separately before changing the dependency floor"
parent: pm-jira-backend-context
